const UNITS=[[1e30,'Qn','QUINTILLIONS 🛸'],[1e27,'Qd','QUADRILLIARDS'],[1e24,'Q','QUADRILLIONS 🤑'],[1e21,'Td','TRILLIARDS'],[1e18,'T','TRILLIONS 🤯'],[1e15,'Bd','BILLIARDS'],[1e12,'Bn','BILLIONS'],[1e9,'Md','MILLIARDS'],[1e6,'M','MILLIONS'],[1e3,'k','MILLIERS']];
